{"repositoryId":1228178587,"availability":"available","full":"htyu179/Chinese-students-US-grad-market-dashboard","name":"Chinese-students-US-grad-market-dashboard","description":"Streamlit dashboard analyzing Chinese graduate enrollment in the U.S. using Open Doors data.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-03T17:41:21Z","updated":"2026-05-05T17:34:24Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://china-us-grad-dashboard.streamlit.app/","topics":["dashboard","data-analysis","education-data","market-research","matplotlib","pandas","python","streamlit"],"demo":"https://china-us-grad-dashboard.streamlit.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T00:54:39.665Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T00:54:39.665Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T00:54:39.665Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-17T00:54:39.665Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This portfolio project explores whether Chinese demand for U.S. graduate or master's study still appears meaningful in the recent post-2020 period.","In this project, “meaningful demand” means that Chinese graduate-level enrollment in the U.S. remains substantial in absolute size and does not show evidence of severe collapse during the observed period. Because enrollment data reflects students already studying in the U.S., it is treated as an indicator for market demand rather than a direct measure of current application activity.","The project uses public international-student enrollment data. It does not claim to measure current applications directly."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/htyu179/Chinese-students-US-grad-market-dashboard/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"e32496f2160306a320d3fd91aa5ff1ccbc352c039a441b4036133c2bd84841a6","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T00:54:39.773Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T00:54:39.773Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This portfolio project explores w